#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomFinancialPlatformCoreCompletion.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Complete the shared financial platform control plane across currencies,
#   parties, accounts, instruments, trades, positions, payments, ledger,
#   settlement, reconciliation, workflow and audit.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   Existing Umicom::finance reference data, banking, payments, accounting,
#   settlement, valuation and regulatory engines remain authoritative. This
#   platform adds cross-domain control, lifecycle and evidence composition
#   without creating competing financial data models in applications.
#
# AUTHOR AND ORGANISATION:
#   Sammy Hegab
#   Umicom Foundation
#
# LICENCE:
#   MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
